+Published Chromium computed none while preview computed URL. The installed Lightning CSS reproduced this when the standard declaration preceded an identical WebKit one: output retained only the unsupported prefixed property. Reversing equivalent declarations keeps both. Application CSS pairs now use prefixed-first/standard-last and verify-built-glass.mjs asserts standard SVG/substrate/fallback rules in the built artifact. Preview success alone was insufficient evidence for published optics.
